


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_ab7cb6a7:



    voice "RIN_0692"
    rin "「……75分。是佳作呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_2e0e70c9:


    "手指划过最后一行，伦合上书，将眼镜放在桌上。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_dc0bc0c2:



    voice "RIN_0693"
    rin "「阳菜，该吃午饭了吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_85df44d0:



    voice "HIN_0903"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_d4976474:


    "阳菜没有回应。也许是因为她戴了耳机。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_756e52ed:


    "阳菜坐在自己桌前，不停地开关相机的胶片盖。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_3d8f0b60:


    "刚才文出去之后，她就一直是这个样子。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_cc56ce1c:



    voice "RIN_0694"
    rin "「小——阳——菜！」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_828ca8ab:



    voice "HIN_0904"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_b687327d:



    voice "RIN_0695"
    rin "「真没办法啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_65e6da34:


    "伦从坐垫上站起。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_ebc14bb6:



    voice "RIN_0696"
    rin "「阳——菜」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_3265e6f8:



    voice "HIN_0905"
    hina "「呀啊！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_1c06869d:


    "伦只是从后面轻轻拍了拍肩膀，阳菜就跳了起来，差点没把椅子给踢翻。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_b8bd747f:


    "落在地上的耳机传出巨大的声音。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_5d0f8c74:



    voice "RIN_0697"
    rin "「喂喂，干嘛这么吃惊？有些伤人呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_c8800663:



    voice "HIN_0906"
    hina "「……抱歉」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_7dee6762:



    voice "RIN_0698"
    rin "「诶，啊，不是……也不需要那样沉重地道歉啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_78c122c3:


    "或许是对阳菜率直的反应感到意外，伦反而惊慌失措起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_a0de8570:



    voice "HIN_0907"
    hina "「有什么事吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_a6a91c80:



    voice "RIN_0699"
    rin "「嗯。差不多该午饭了，要吃些什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_21ffa34e:



    voice "HIN_0908"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_9e258747:



    voice "RIN_0700"
    rin "「浅生准备了牛肉盖浇饭，我们热一下吃？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_0888259a:



    voice "HIN_0909"
    hina "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_37500793:



    voice "RIN_0701"
    rin "「……那，我去热饭了。阳菜在桌子那里等着？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_d91ab9fa:


    "阳菜点了点头，照伦所说站起身来。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_d7da180a:



    voice "RIN_0702"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_3f5566c1:



    voice "RIN_0703"
    rin "「好，久等了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_14af315e:


    "伦把勺子放进盘里，再端到了桌上。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_023196ad:



    voice "HIN_0910"
    hina "「谢了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_b98b3909:



    voice "RIN_0704"
    rin "「我说啊，你觉得往牛肉盖饭上加奶酪味道怎么样？会好吃吗？还是难吃？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_9f4cafa0:



    voice "HIN_0911"
    hina "「我没试过所以不知道」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_bb6997b3:



    voice "RIN_0705"
    rin "「那么，牛肉盖浇饭（Hayashi rice）这个名称的起源你知道吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_c69dcc20:



    voice "HIN_0912"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_20a877af:



    voice "RIN_0706"
    rin "「有人说是hashed的谐音，有人说是由早矢仕（hayashi）的人名起源而来，还有人说是快饭（hayai rice）误读成盖饭等，另外也有其他说法……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_3aca9cda:



    voice "HIN_0913"
    hina "「这样啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_53e0ca07:



    voice "RIN_0707"
    rin "「……你不感兴趣吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_b47154de:



    voice "HIN_0914"
    hina "「诶，不，也不是不感兴趣」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_8afa3629:


    "这之后也是伦单方面提出新的话题，阳菜只是随声附和。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_7c1bcb74:



    voice "HIN_0915"
    hina "「我吃饱了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_6d5a1111:


    "先吃完的阳菜拿起餐具站起身。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_a7ff0119:



    voice "RIN_0708"
    rin "「啊，放洗碗池就行。待会我一起洗了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_e51f18b1:



    voice "HIN_0916"
    hina "「可以吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_b8b9bf66:



    voice "RIN_0709"
    rin "「嗯嗯。啊，你作业写了吗？有什么不懂的我可以教你」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_21e4289e:



    voice "HIN_0917"
    hina "「嗯。但是今天没什么问题」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_55c26222:



    voice "RIN_0710"
    rin "「是吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_5b3393ba:



    voice "HIN_0918"
    hina "「那个……我稍微出去一下」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_8ec0a72b:


    "阳菜将餐具放进水池后，来到玄关处蹲下身穿起鞋子。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_fc5ddf9b:



    voice "RIN_0711"
    rin "「诶，等一下，穿上外套比较——」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_043bf186:


    "阳菜头都不回地就慌张出门了。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_8223368c:



    voice "RIN_0712"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_05_bb5f7695:


    "伦怔怔盯着阳菜离开的方向。"
